  "title": {
    "raw": "Auditions for 'A Christmas Carol' Live Radio Play Set for October",
    "rendered": "Auditions for &#8216;A Christmas Carol&#8217; Live Radio Play Set for October"
  },
  "content": {
    "raw": "<p>Auditions are underway for a live radio adaptation of Charles Dickens' classic, 'A Christmas Carol.' The production aims to bring the beloved story to life with sound effects, multiple characters, and holiday cheer.</p> <p>The audition process is casting five featured roles, including three men and two women, of all ages. Additional roles may be available. No prior radio experience is necessary, according to organizers.</p> <p>Auditions will be held October 11 at 2 p.m. and October 12 at 6 p.m. at TCT Off-Broadway, located at 213 East Franklin Street. Audition material will be provided on-site.</p> <p>The play is scheduled for performance December 10 to 12. Organizers say the production aims to capture the spirit of Christmas and remind audiences what the season is truly about.</p>\n\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/1458840056250572/posts/1710341214433787\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Original Article</a></em></p>",
    "rendered": "<p>Auditions are underway for a live radio adaptation of Charles Dickens&#8217; classic, &#8216;A Christmas Carol.&#8217; The production aims to bring the beloved story to life with sound effects, multiple characters, and holiday cheer.</p>\n<p>The audition process is casting five featured roles, including three men and two women, of all ages. Additional roles may be available. No prior radio experience is necessary, according to organizers.</p>\n<p>Auditions will be held October 11 at 2 p.m. and October 12 at 6 p.m. at TCT Off-Broadway, located at 213 East Franklin Street. Audition material will be provided on-site.</p>\n<p>The play is scheduled for performance December 10 to 12. Organizers say the production aims to capture the spirit of Christmas and remind audiences what the season is truly about.</p>\n<p><em>Source: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/1458840056250572/posts/1710341214433787\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Original Article</a></em></p>\n",
    "protected": false,
    "block_version": 0
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "raw": "The production seeks five featured actors for a holiday-themed live radio adaptation of 'A Christmas Carol.' No experience is required, and auditions are scheduled for October.",
    "rendered": "<p>The production seeks five featured actors for a holiday-themed live radio adaptation of &#8216;A Christmas Carol.&#8217; No experience is required, and auditions are scheduled for October.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
